'''Thrawn's sparring gym'''<ref name="Behind the Scenes Gallery">{{SW|url=series/star-wars-rebels/through-imperial-eyes-behind-the-scenes-gallery|text="Through Imperial Eyes" Behind-the-Scenes Gallery}} {{C|Slide 1}}</ref> was a room designed and equipped for exercise aboard the [[Imperial I-class Star Destroyer|''Imperial I''-class Star Destroyer]] ''[[Chimaera]]'', the [[flagship]] of [[Grand Admiral]] [[Mitth'raw'nuruodo|Thrawn]]. In that room, the Grand Admiral used to train in [[Unarmed combat|hand-to-hand combat]] by fighting [[DT-series sentry droid]]s. There were a number of [[melee weapon]]s placed on racks on the walls.<ref name="Through Imperial Eyes" />

